---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const title = "Anping Wire Mesh: China's Wire Mesh Manufacturing Hub";
const description = "Anping County produces 80% of China's wire mesh. Learn about its industrial clusters, product specializations, quality tiers, and how to source effectively.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <!-- Hero with Stats -->
  <section class="bg-theme-secondary border-b border-theme py-16">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">INDUSTRY CLUSTER PROFILE</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-theme-primary">Anping Wire Mesh</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-theme-secondary max-w-2xl mb-2">
        Anping County in Hebei Province produces an estimated 80% of China's wire mesh.
      </p>
      <p class="text-base text-theme-muted mb-8">
        China's wire mesh look to Anping — a single thread woven into a $12 billion industry.
      </p>

      <!-- Key Stats Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-theme-accent">15,000+</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mt-1">Registered Enterprises</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted">Across Anping County</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-theme-accent">$12B+</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mt-1">Annual Output Value</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted">2025 Estimate</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-theme-accent">60%</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mt-1">Export Ratio</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted">60+ Countries</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-theme-accent">500<span class="text-lg">yrs</span></p>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mt-1">Industry Heritage</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted">Since Ming Dynasty</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Breadcrumb -->
  <nav class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 text-sm text-theme-muted">
    <a href="/" class="hover:text-theme-accent">Home</a> / Anping Wire Mesh
  </nav>

  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-8">
    <!-- Main Content -->
    <article class="flex-1 min-w-0">
    <!-- Overview -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">Why Anping Dominates Wire Mesh</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        Anping's wire mesh industry dates to the Ming Dynasty, when local craftsmen wove silk
        for military use. Modern industrial production began in the 1950s and expanded
        dramatically after China's reform era. Today the county hosts thousands of registered
        wire mesh manufacturers, ranging from small workshops to large export-oriented factories.
      </p>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        The concentration creates several advantages for buyers:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-theme-secondary space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li><strong class="text-theme-primary">Complete supply chain</strong> — Wire drawing, weaving, welding, galvanizing, and PVC coating all happen locally</li>
        <li><strong class="text-theme-primary">Competitive pricing</strong> — Intense local competition keeps margins thin</li>
        <li><strong class="text-theme-primary">Product variety</strong> — From 5-micron filter mesh to heavy mining screens</li>
        <li><strong class="text-theme-primary">Export infrastructure</strong> — Many factories have 10+ years of export experience</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Industrial Zones -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">Key Industrial Zones</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        Anping's wire mesh production is concentrated in several townships, each with
        different specializations:
      </p>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Area</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Specialization</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Factory Type</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Anping Town (county seat)</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Woven wire mesh, filter mesh</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Medium to large manufacturers</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Taocheng Township</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Welded wire mesh, fence panels</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Mixed sizes, export-focused</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Hebin Township</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Galvanized wire, barbed wire</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Wire drawing specialists</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Mazhuang Township</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Gabion baskets, hexagonal mesh</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Heavy mesh fabricators</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Industrial Development Zone</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">High-end stainless steel mesh</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Larger, certified factories</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Product Specialization Map -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">Product Specializations</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        Different areas of Anping excel at different products. Matching your needs to the
        right specialization improves quality and pricing:
      </p>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 bg-theme-card">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">Woven Wire Mesh</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            Traditional strength. Factories here produce everything from coarse 2-mesh
            screens to ultra-fine 500-mesh filter cloth. Stainless steel and brass are
            common materials.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 bg-theme-card">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">Welded Wire Mesh</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            Post-weld galvanizing and PVC coating lines are concentrated in specific
            workshops. Quality varies significantly—visit or audit before large orders.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 bg-theme-card">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">Fence Systems</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            Complete production chains for 3D fence panels, chain link, and palisade fences.
            Accessories (posts, clamps, gates) often sourced from adjacent workshops.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 bg-theme-card">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">Gabions & Geotextiles</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            Heavy hexagonal mesh weaving and gabion assembly. Some factories offer
            design assistance for retaining wall projects.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Industry Chain -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">Complete Industry Chain</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        Anping's advantage lies in its fully localized supply chain. Every production stage
        happens within the county, reducing lead times and enabling rapid customization:
      </p>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 mb-4">
        <div class="bg-theme-tertiary border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl mb-2">🔧</p>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary text-sm mb-1">Wire Drawing</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted">Raw steel → wire coils</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-theme-tertiary border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl mb-2">🧵</p>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary text-sm mb-1">Weaving & Welding</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted">Mesh formation</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-theme-tertiary border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl mb-2">⚙️</p>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary text-sm mb-1">Deep Processing</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted">Cutting, shaping, coating</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-theme-tertiary border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl mb-2">🌍</p>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary text-sm mb-1">Export & Trade</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted">Logistics, customs</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-4">
        <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
          <strong class="text-theme-primary">Key insight:</strong> This vertical integration means a fence panel
          order can go from steel coil to container in 15-20 days. For buyers, this translates
          to faster sampling, easier customization, and lower coordination costs compared to
          sourcing from dispersed suppliers.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- What We Are / What We Are Not -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-2">About This Site</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-5">
        MeshCalculator is an independent information resource for global buyers sourcing wire mesh from Anping.
        We are not affiliated with any factory, trading company, or government body.
      </p>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="border border-green-500/30 rounded-lg p-5 bg-green-500/5">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-green-400 mb-4">We are</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-green-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5">✓</span>
              <span>An industry information hub — product specs, pricing benchmarks, and cluster data in one place</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-green-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5">✓</span>
              <span>Free technical tools — weight calculators, FOB estimators, and inquiry generators built for buyers</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-green-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5">✓</span>
              <span>A direct bridge — your inquiry goes to factories, not to us or a reseller</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-red-500/30 rounded-lg p-5 bg-red-500/5">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-red-400 mb-4">We are not</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-red-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5">✗</span>
              <span>A trading company — we don't participate in transactions, don't touch money, don't earn commissions</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-red-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5">✗</span>
              <span>A paid ranking — no factory pays for better placement or a "verified" badge</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-red-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5">✗</span>
              <span>A government portal — we write for buyers, not officials</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Export Markets -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">Where Anping Wire Mesh Goes</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-5">
        Anping exports to 60+ countries. The cluster's output is distributed unevenly by product type —
        different markets demand different specifications.
      </p>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-5">
        <div class="border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 bg-theme-card">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-2">LARGEST MARKETS</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li class="flex justify-between items-center">
              <span class="text-theme-secondary">United States</span>
              <span class="text-theme-primary font-medium">~20%</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex justify-between items-center">
              <span class="text-theme-secondary">European Union</span>
              <span class="text-theme-primary font-medium">~18%</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex justify-between items-center">
              <span class="text-theme-secondary">Southeast Asia</span>
              <span class="text-theme-primary font-medium">~15%</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex justify-between items-center">
              <span class="text-theme-secondary">Middle East</span>
              <span class="text-theme-primary font-medium">~12%</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex justify-between items-center">
              <span class="text-theme-secondary">Africa</span>
              <span class="text-theme-primary font-medium">~10%</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex justify-between items-center border-t border-theme pt-2 mt-1">
              <span class="text-theme-muted text-xs">Others (40+ countries)</span>
              <span class="text-theme-muted font-medium text-xs">~25%</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 bg-theme-card">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-2">WHAT EACH MARKET BUYS</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            <li><span class="text-theme-primary font-medium">US / EU</span> — stainless filter mesh, precision woven, compliance-certified products</li>
            <li><span class="text-theme-primary font-medium">SE Asia</span> — welded mesh, fence panels, construction-grade products</li>
            <li><span class="text-theme-primary font-medium">Middle East</span> — security fencing, gabions, heavy-duty mesh</li>
            <li><span class="text-theme-primary font-medium">Africa</span> — chain link, welded rolls, basic fence systems</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 bg-theme-card">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-2">KEY TRADE FAIRS</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-theme-accent shrink-0">→</span>
              <span><span class="text-theme-primary font-medium">Canton Fair</span> (Guangzhou, Apr & Oct) — largest general fair, most Anping factories attend</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-theme-accent shrink-0">→</span>
              <span><span class="text-theme-primary font-medium">Anping Wire Mesh Fair</span> (Anping, Oct) — on-site at the cluster, specialized</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-theme-accent shrink-0">→</span>
              <span><span class="text-theme-primary font-medium">Bauma / Intermat</span> — relevant for construction mesh buyers in EU market</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-theme-tertiary border border-theme rounded-lg p-4">
        <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
          <strong class="text-theme-primary">Sourcing tip:</strong> If you're buying for a regulated market (US, EU, Australia),
          prioritize factories with documented test reports and export experience in your region.
          Factories exporting primarily to Africa or the Middle East may use different quality standards.
          Always specify your destination market when requesting quotes.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Factory Directory Coming Soon -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">Factory Directory</h2>
      <div class="border border-theme rounded-lg p-6 bg-theme-card">
        <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
          We are building a verified directory of Anping wire mesh manufacturers.
          Each listing will include product range, certifications, export experience, and direct contact —
          no paid rankings, no trading company entries.
        </p>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-5 text-sm">
          <div class="bg-theme-tertiary rounded-lg p-3">
            <p class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">What we'll include</p>
            <ul class="text-theme-secondary space-y-1 text-xs">
              <li>✓ Product range & specialization</li>
              <li>✓ Factory size (worker count)</li>
              <li>✓ Certifications held</li>
              <li>✓ Main export markets</li>
              <li>✓ Years in operation</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-theme-tertiary rounded-lg p-3">
            <p class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">What we won't do</p>
            <ul class="text-theme-secondary space-y-1 text-xs">
              <li>✗ Sell listing positions</li>
              <li>✗ List trading companies as factories</li>
              <li>✗ Mark unverified data as verified</li>
              <li>✗ Charge buyers to contact factories</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-theme-tertiary rounded-lg p-3">
            <p class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">Are you a factory?</p>
            <p class="text-theme-secondary text-xs mb-2">List your factory for free. No fees, no commission, no paid placement.</p>
            <a href="/inquiry/" class="inline-block text-xs accent-bg font-semibold px-3 py-1.5 rounded hover:opacity-90 transition" style="color: #07090c;">
              Register your factory →
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="/factories/" class="text-theme-accent hover:underline text-sm">Check directory status →</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Quality Tiers -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">Quality Tiers</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        Anping factories cluster into distinct quality tiers. Knowing which tier you need
        prevents both overpaying and quality disasters:
      </p>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Tier</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Characteristics</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Best For</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme font-medium text-theme-primary">Workshop</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">5-20 workers, basic equipment, limited QC</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Simple products, price-sensitive orders</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme font-medium text-theme-primary">Small Factory</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">20-50 workers, some automation, basic testing</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Standard products, small to medium volumes</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme font-medium text-theme-primary">Medium Factory</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50-200 workers, modern lines, full QC department</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Export orders, consistent quality requirements</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme font-medium text-theme-primary">Large Manufacturer</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">200+ workers, ISO certification, R&D capability</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Technical products, long-term contracts, OEM</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-theme-tertiary border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 mb-4">
        <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
          <strong class="text-theme-primary">Practical note:</strong> Many trading companies in Anping present themselves
          as factories. They're not necessarily bad—good traders add value through QC and
          logistics—but know what you're paying for. Ask for factory registration documents
          and production line photos if direct factory pricing matters to you.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Structured Procurement Guide -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">Procurement Quick Reference</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        Typical specifications, price ranges, and minimum order quantities for common Anping products.
        Use as a baseline when evaluating quotes.
      </p>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Product</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Typical Spec</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Price Range*</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">MOQ</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Lead Time</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-primary font-medium">Stainless woven mesh</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">304/316, 20-200 mesh</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$8-25/kg</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50-100 m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">15-25 days</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-primary font-medium">Galvanized welded mesh</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">1/2"-4" aperture, 1-3mm wire</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$3-8/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">500-1000 m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">10-20 days</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-primary font-medium">3D fence panel</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50×200mm, 4mm wire, PVC coated</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$12-28/panel</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">200-500 panels</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">20-30 days</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-primary font-medium">Gabion basket</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">2×1×1m, 80×100mm mesh</td>
